  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Secure Scuttlebutt -- an offline-first, gossip-protocol P2P social database where each user has a signed append-only log. Data syncs peer-to-peer when connections are available -- ideal for remote, offline, or censorship-resistant OASIS deployments. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
